    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Abiya iri gwaá', kuri foól baraá gixsár Daudi, garmaawós Asa kitaangós gway óh. Qoomár waawuti'iimár Asawo wayda iri deeruút baraá yaamuwo ay kureeri mibaangw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa dabaá hhohho' gina tleéhh nee hhooeema gina tleéhh geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGUHE, Munguúwós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baraá yaamuwo kiteeraá munguaá hatlá' kiwa sluufmiís gina hingeés nee wa/ameedár gongooama' ar munguaá hatlá' kiwa slufmiisi gari hingeés nee uheemidaá giri tlaáq, slaqsi'iidaá Ashera giri supín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa múk Yuda guna ádbay, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú baabi'ii'ín nguwa leelehhiya', nee dabeerós nee hara'ayarose ngiwa iialooeesiya'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós sleeme kiteeraá munguaá hatlá' kiwa sluufmamisi, kudaá gawaá gongooama' nee kiteeraá mooyángw tsuú' kuwa hanmamisi, gina hingeés baraá gixsadaá Yuda sleémeero, nee yaamuuwós niri waydúr hootiyé' qoomár waawuti'iimarose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár yaamu iwa wayduú kona', Asa gixsadaá koo/i gawden gina tleéhh baraá Yudawo, slaqwara naa ti'iitiká baraá kureeridae, asma AAKOÓ MUNGÚ wayda nguwa haniís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós múk Yuda guri báy, «Gimsé', gixsaduurén i harweeraán ar koo/ír gawit, nee /aampu nee afe kay tseegaán. Yaamu i gawaá dabaarén i diri'iyá', asma atén AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúrén una leelehhaán. Inós atén una leelehhaán, tiri waydií haniís umuú barto.» Naagáy inooín gixsadu ngiri aleeslayé' tleehharo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Asa slaqwaruusér gaambaá koom nee ar lawlaá koom ngi kon a kume tsiire tám baraá múk Yudawo, nee baraá múk Benyaminiwo a muu kume tsiire tsár nee mibeeri dakaát, oo gaambaá koóm nee oo lawlaá koóm. Kuká' sleémeero an miguusér slaqwara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sera heé yaamaá Kushi yaamaá Yuda gina i haratláy ar slaqwaruusér kume kumuú wák nee gaardaá tsiire tám, iri geerií kumiít ay Maresha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa iri tláy as nee inós tiwa doogiya'. Inooín tsaraawo tiri amohhe'eesiyé' baraá xatstá Sefata tidár iisaapoó Maresha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa iri /aá/ dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúwós, iri oó', «Aá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, diroge dimbé i káhh gár ta alee/iimis bar slaqwaruusér /uuruú koom laqaá ar daqatlakw. AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúrén, atén kuúng ti alee/is, asma atén kuúng ugwa harahhifaán, ar baraá umuuwoge atén naa slaqwarár awaán dír slaqwaruuseérí yaariir. Aá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, kuúng an Munguúrén, ala kuúng ma ya/amaar nee hee tiwa tlampa'asa'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy AAKOÓ MUNGÚ múk yaamaá Kushi guri baál geeraá Asa nee múk Yuda. Múk Kushi iri goów. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Asa dinkwa nee slaqwaruuseerós mukdá' kway guús ay Gerari, múk yaariír oo Kushi kuri tsuú/, tam oo aa meet i kaahh, asma inooín kaa baál nee AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nee slaqwaruuseerós. Slaqwaruusér Yuda haasaánguú yaariír guri hayoohiín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gixsadaá iisapoó Gerari giri arbaá/, asma múk baraá gixsaduudá' ina da'ayuút as AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. Slaqwaruusér Yuda haasaánguú yaariír guri ar tleér, asma baraadae muruú yaariír i ló'wa deer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slaqwaruusér múk Yuda sleeme de'eemuusér bee/aangw gana /amatsék, kiri bee/aangw hayóh nee aaraawo nee angamíaro. Nay ki/iyé' ay Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
